OL,3,GNEWSABudget backs Stratford
OL,4,AInternational rail plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has pledged to work with
OL,7,FLondon's City Hall to enable
OL,8,Finternational rail services to stop at
OL,9,FStratford International station for the
OL,10,Ffirst time.
OL,12,FThe commitment was included in Budget
OL,13,Fdocuments which state the government
OL,14,Fwill work with the Greater London
OL,15,FAuthority (GLA) to make the move
OL,16,Fpossible.
OL,18,FMayor of London Lord Sadiq Khan
OL,19,Fwelcomed the announcement, saying he
OL,20,Fwas "delighted" after lobbying for
OL,21,Fcross-Channel rail services at the
OL,22,Fstation "for many years".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
