OL,3,GNEWSABudget backs Stratford
OL,4,AInternational rail plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the move would make it "truly
OL,7,Finternational for the first time" and
OL,8,F"open up huge opportunities for jobs,
OL,9,Finvestment and tourism".
